  "name": "Chicken Salad with Grapes",
  "subtitle": "A chilled chicken salad with crisp celery and sweet grapes",
  "description": "Mix drained chicken with fresh vegetables, grapes, dill, and a tangy-sweet mayonnaise dressing, then serve in split croissants.",
